# A 20mm calibration cube: closed, manifold, and the corpus's first measurable
# reference. Volume is exactly 8000 mm^3, so anything scaled to match it can be
# checked by hand rather than trusted.
o ref_cube_20mm
v 0 0 0
v 20 0 0
v 20 20 0
v 0 20 0
v 0 0 20
v 20 0 20
v 20 20 20
v 0 20 20
f 1 4 3 2
f 5 6 7 8
f 1 2 6 5
f 2 3 7 6
f 3 4 8 7
f 4 1 5 8
